#: ../../.opencode/commands/diagnose.md:67
msgid "Session Title"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/diagnose.md:69
msgid ""
"On the **first interaction**, set a concise session title reflecting the "
"bug being diagnosed (e.g. \"diagnose: null pointer in cart total\", "
"\"diagnose: PROJ-456 export timeout\")."
msgstr ""

